OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAIntelligence officer's rare Aston
OL,4,AMartin to be sold
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Aston Martin car owned by a British
OL,7,Fintelligence officer, and of the same
OL,8,Fmodel made famous by the James Bond
OL,9,Ffilms, is expected to fetch up to
OL,10,F#400,000 when it goes to auction.
OL,12,FThe red Aston Martin DB5 Sports Saloon
OL,13,Fcar will go on sale at Sandown Park in
OL,14,FEsher, Surrey.
OL,16,FIt was owned by PH Manners Wood, who
OL,17,Finterpreted decoded enigma messages at
OL,18,FBletchley Park during World War Two,
OL,19,Fand who bought the car in the same year
OL,20,FBond first hit the big screen.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
