OL,3,GNEWSAIntelligence officer's rare Aston
OL,4,AMartin to be sold
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Cheetham, of auctioneers H&H
OL,7,FClassics, said: "James Bond was not the
OL,8,Fonly British intelligence officer to
OL,9,Ftake delivery of an Aston Martin DB5
OL,10,Fduring 1964, as seen with this
OL,11,Fwonderful example first owned by
OL,12,FManners Wood."
